{"id": "141906", "name": "מרחבי מכפלה פנימית - טענות כלליות - 17", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div>\n<p>עבור וקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\in V\\)</span> ותת-מרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\subseteq V\\)</span> נתונים, נסמן את ההטלה האורתוגונלית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span> על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P_U(v)\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P_U(v) = 0_V\\)</span>, אז לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\in U\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\perp u\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בשאלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span> הוא מרחב מכפלה פנימית נוצר סופית מעל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span>. נזכיר: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P_U(v)\\in U\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v-P_U(v)\\in U^{\\perp}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הצבה</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v-P_U(v)\\in U^{\\perp}\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P_U(v)=0_V\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v=v-0_V\\in U^{\\perp}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — מסקנה</b><br>כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle v,u\\rangle=0\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\in U\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\perp u\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}